                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "When it comes to extending tax cuts for the wealthiest Americans, Republicans show up.\n\nWhen it comes to keeping the government open and preventing the highest health care premium increase in 15 years, Republicans are nowhere to be found.\n\nDemocrats will always show up to fight for the American people and protect their health insurance.",
