                "reply_count": 22,
                "retweet_count": 15,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "People are already feeling the sticker shock of their skyrocketing 2026 health care premiums.\n\nWe're here in Washington ready to do something about it, but Republicans need to be here too. https://t.co/20ImTW2dzW",
                "text_lang": "en",
