                "quoted_status_profile_username": "Acyn",
                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "What's included in the \"America first\" agenda?\n\n\u274c Reopening the government\n\u274c Protecting the health care of millions of Americans\n\u274c Ensuring the delivery of SNAP benefits\n\u274c Paying dedicated public servants\n\u2705\"The ballroom is really the president's main priority.\"",
