                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The President calls negotiating to prevent the doubling and tripling of your health care costs a \"waste of time.\"\n\n22 million Americans call it the difference between affordable health care and financial ruin.\n\nhttps://t.co/hOdEE70A2K",
