                "text": "The consequences of Republican inaction will be felt in every corner of America.\n\nIf ACA credits are not extended before the end of the year, 1 in 4 Americans are considering giving up their health insurance. No one should ever have to choose between paying their medical bills and putting food on the table.  \n\nBut President Trump thinks affordability is just a hoax.",
